# Drives `122_withdraw_nested`. The rule fires on Go + Job 1 and arms a
# 5_s timer; a twin Job 1 arrives before it fires. 5_s later the timer's
# body withdraws the matched Job and emits a Check, and `left` logs the one
# Job that remains.
assert Go n=1
assert Job id=1
pump
assert Job id=1
pump
advance 5000000000
pump
